{
  "id": "HOS.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 5",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this, O ye priests, and hearken, O house of Israel, and give ear, O house of the king; for unto you pertaineth the judgment; for ye have been a snare at Mizpah, and a net spread upon Tabor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the revolters are gone deep in making slaughter; but I am a rebuker of them all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I know Ephraim, and Israel is not hid from me; for now, O Ephraim, thou hast played the harlot, Israel is defiled. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their doings will not suffer them to turn unto their God; for the spirit of whoredom is within them, and they know not Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the pride of Israel doth testify to his face: therefore Israel and Ephraim shall stumble in their iniquity; Judah also shall stumble with them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall go with their flocks and with their herds to seek Jehovah; but they shall not find him: he hath withdrawn himself from them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have dealt treacherously against Jehovah; for they have borne strange children: now shall the new moon devour them with their fields.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blow ye the cornet in Gibeah, and the trumpet in Ramah: sound an alarm at Beth-aven; behind thee, O Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim shall become a desolation in the day of rebuke: among the tribes of Israel have I made known that which shall surely be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The princes of Judah are like them that remove the landmark: I will pour out my wrath upon them like water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim is oppressed, he is crushed in judgment; because he was content to walk after ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " command. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore am I unto Ephraim as a moth, and to the house of Judah as rottenness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Ephraim saw his sickness, and Judah ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " his wound, then went Ephraim to Assyria, and sent to king Jareb: but he is not able to heal you, neither will he cure you of your wound. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will be unto Ephraim as a lion, and as a young lion to the house of Judah: I, even I, will tear and go away; I will carry off, and there shall be none to deliver. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will go and return to my place, till they acknowledge their offence, and seek my face: in their affliction they will seek me earnestly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
